[en.CHARACTER_TOUGH_BREAK_NAME]
Tough Break

[en.CHARACTER_TOUGH_BREAK_DESC]
Tough Break, sturdy and efficient, was a staunch enforcer of justice. Though he might seem aloof to his subordinates, in his eyes, he was simply following the rules. Previously, he had served as captain and president of a private security company, providing security services for numerous large businesses, particularly Joyful Enterprises owned by Cheese Sandwich, to make a living. Now, as the flames of war once again engulfed Equestria, he expanded his operations and transformed his security company into a mercenary force. Privately, he also provided escort services for many fleeing civilians, charging only nominal fees. With his wealth of experience, he knew how to defend the most vulnerable points with the fewest soldiers.

[zh.CHARACTER_TOUGH_BREAK_NAME]
塔夫·布瑞克

[zh.CHARACTER_TOUGH_BREAK_DESC]
塔夫·布瑞克（Tough Break）身材魁梧，雷厉风行，奉行正义，虽然在下属眼中似乎有些不近马情，但在他眼中他只是在按规矩办事。此前的身份是一家私人安保公司的队长和总裁，一直为多家涉及商业的大型企业提供安保服务来维持生计，尤其是芝士三明治的欢乐集团。如今战火再一次在小马利亚熊熊燃烧，他扩大了他的业务并且将安保公司转变成一支雇佣军，私下里也为许多逃难的小马群众提供护卫服务，并只收取象征性的金钱。经验丰富的他懂得如何用最少的士兵防守住最容易受到攻击的地方。
